OL,3,GNEWSASecond life term for PC killer
OL,4,Aover gun conspiracy
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the men convicted of killing a
OL,7,Fpolice officer has been handed a second
OL,8,Flife sentence for his role in a gun
OL,9,Fconspiracy.
OL,11,FFaisal Razzaq started selling firearms
OL,12,Fto criminals after he served a prison
OL,13,Fsentence for his role in a botched
OL,14,Frobbery that ended in PC Sharon
OL,15,FBeshenivsky being shot dead in
OL,16,FBradford, West Yorkshire.
OL,18,FRazzaq was convicted of manslaughter in
OL,19,F2006 and was sentenced to life with a
OL,20,Fminimum of 11 years in prison. He was
OL,21,Fgiven parole in 2017.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
