OL,3,GNEWSASecond life term for PC killer
OL,4,Aover gun conspiracy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 45-year-old was one of six people
OL,7,Fsentenced on Thursday for his
OL,8,Finvolvement in a firearms conspiracy
OL,9,Fwhich supplied weapons to gangs across
OL,10,FLondon.
